howdy-next (3.4.0-3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Keep howdy-compare as an ELF binary. A shell wrapper caused dash/bash
    to drop sudo's root euid, so PAM could not read /etc/howdy/config.ini.

 -- Jochem Kuipers <JochemKuipers+howdy-next-apt@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 09:25:00 +0000

